  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Brush",
      "affiliation": "Ampex Corporation Redwood City, CA 94063",
      "bio": "Richard Brush has been senior engineer at Ampex Corp. Audio Video Systems since 1983, engaged in digital VTR engineering research, design, and development. Presently he is on the 4:2:2 (D-1 format) project team. He was previously senior engineer at Compression Labs., Inc. (San Jose, CA) engaged in design of video teleconferencing codec (1982 to 1983): an engineer at Ampex Corp. Data Services Div. (Redwood City, CA) engaged in design of super high bit rate digital data recorder (1978 to 1982): and a computer programming consultant, in scientific, engineering and business applications (1965 to 1978). He holds a BSEE, 1978, from the University of Utah, magna cum laude, and a MSEE, 1983, from Stanford University."
    }
